{"id":"fd829148f31abddc","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-pspace.md","title":"Polynomial Space","display":"df-pspace — Polynomial Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-dspace]]"],"display":"df-pspace — Polynomial Space","label":"28-df-pspace","aliases":["28-df-pspace"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4382c6bdd7033833\" href=\"?note=4382c6bdd7033833\" title=\"28-df-dspace\">28-df-dspace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pspace — Polynomial Space"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-pspace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-pspace</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{DSPACE}(t)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4382c6bdd7033833\" href=\"?note=4382c6bdd7033833\" title=\"28-df-dspace\">28-df-dspace</a> 中容许常数因子的二进制语言资源类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n+2)^a\">\\((n+2)^a\\)</span> 统一处理空串与短输入；在容许常数因子的复杂度约定下与通常的多项式并类一致。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义4.5；印刷81页；PDF107页。对应并类陈述已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-dspace","status":"resolved","id":"4382c6bdd7033833","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-dspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-dspace","status":"resolved","id":"4382c6bdd7033833","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DSPACE}(t)$ 是 [[28-df-dspace]] 中容许常数因子的二进制语言资源类；$a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{DSPACE}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).","display":true},{"tex":"(n+2)^a","display":false}],"bytes":758,"backlinks":[{"id":"c36828ce471a79d1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a39964177c0e0048","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[28-df-pspace]]，$\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}$ 见 [[28-df-poly-reduction]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"基本复杂性类：[[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-np]]、[[28-df-conp]]、[[28-df-l]]、[[28-df-nl]]、[[28-df-pspace]]、[[28-df-npspace]]、[[28-df-exp]]、[[28-df-nexp]]。"},{"id":"13847817d539efaf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c590fb7eaa58168d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BQP}$ 采用 [[28-df-bqp]] 的有限有效门库与经典多项式时间统一性；$\\mathbf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[28-df-pspace]]。"},{"id":"e4bbd2ac00e2ea21","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dc66c114284dcdc1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5fedc3d